{"parse": {"title": "TLD-01", "pageid": 23047, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TLD-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/TLD-02\" title=\"TLD-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TLD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.98.B3.E5.85.89.E6.B8.97.E6.BC.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"阳光渗漏\">阳光渗漏</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 阳光渗漏</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Flakes of Light</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夺<span class=\"color-value\"></span>目<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>直<span class=\"color-value\"></span>白<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>刺<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190301</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>修道院里，人群热切地簇拥在敞开的院门两侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为首的男人翘首盼望着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>咳——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是望见了什么，他突然轻咳了两声，快步迎了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也迅速换上了一个更加谄媚的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>帕米埃老爷，我们热切地欢迎您的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大步跨进门的年轻法官迅速摆了摆手，毫不客气地打断了对方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你应该知道我此行的目的，类似的发言并不会影响此地工作的评判结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你大可以把这些话吞回肚子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>想必那些宣读结果的老爷们更擅长与你们玩这些无聊的把戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方挤出一个尴尬的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>感谢您的……建议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>对应的卷宗已经整理好了，请跟我来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕米埃似乎并不打算跟上去，她的目光游离在往来的信众与烛台之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>帕米埃老爷……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>主教先生骄傲地昂起头，似乎对修道院的热闹景象相当满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>如您所见，每天都有许多人前来祷告，他们十分信任我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>嗯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻笑了两声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>您在担心真实性吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>请相信我，大人，我绝不会令主蒙羞……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>主教举起手，熟练地在胸前比划起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>好了，我一点儿也不关心你的起誓，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>这里的酒馆在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他坚决地站定，声音突然洪亮起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>老爷，在工作时间内，我们不应当醉酒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窥见对方的表情并无变化，他又小心翼翼地说了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>而且，这里的酒馆大多数时候是那些潦倒的酒鬼们的天堂，他们满身污垢，袍子上全是泥土和臭虫……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>与您的身份实在不符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>聪慧的主教大人像是终于领悟了什么，他露出一个你我皆知的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>但若是您希望寻找美酒……我正好有一些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你误会了，迈克尔主教。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>我只不过希望得到一个更真实的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你的卷宗上没有写明的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他讪笑了两声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>这是裁判所的意思，还是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>这是我个人的意愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>我明白了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他终于放下心来。主教站直身子，恢复了往常的高傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>难怪您能成为最年轻的主裁判官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>不过，您不担心他人的不满么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>我曾听说过许多……关于您的传闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>主教先生故作忧心地望着对方。遗憾的是，他没能发现哪怕丁点儿退缩的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>那是他们需要考虑的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>没有人是不可取代的，迈克尔主教……当然也包括我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>大瘟疫害死了许多人。可我们在这场灾难中并无作为，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>这并不是我们的错……我们什么也做不了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>但总比什么也不做好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太阳几乎刺得人睁不开眼，她仍固执地抬起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>我并不打算为难你，迈克尔主教——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>我只是希望太阳能照的地方再多一点而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你还有什么疑义吗？迈克尔主教。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>不……我这就去安排人手为您领路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-561201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">迈克尔：</div><div>愿主保佑您。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TLD-01"}}